        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the Market \r\n\r\n4 Bedroom Cut Stone Residence \r\nIn Need of  Refurbishment\r\nOn C0.80 Acre Tree Lined Site \r\n\r\nLocated outside the historical village of Irishtown and only 3 miles off the N17 Galway/Sligo routeway, 40 min drive to Galway City, 40 mins to Knock Airport and only 7 miles from the railway junction town of Claremorris.\r\n\r\nThis is a quality solid structure property, refurbishment partially started where an extension has been started and in the course of construction. However it is being sold as is giving the new  purchaser the opportunity of doing the work to their own desired standard and design.\r\nIt offers: Large lounge with rustic open stone fireplace; Ground floor has new fully insulated floor.\r\nUpstairs: landing and three spacious bedrooms which are ready for walls to be studded.  New roof on the older section of the house and double glazing fitted. \r\nNew Extension: offers kitchen; one downstairs bedroom; bathroom; hallway & stairwell; conservatory.\r\nThis part of the work is under construction. The new extension will also have two en-suite bedrooms when constructed. The new extension has provision for under floor heating. \r\n\r\nGeneral: The electricity connection and water connection have been paid for. There is a stira stairs leading to attic space. \r\nIdeal opportunity to acquire an old stone property of great quality which are hard to come by. \r\n \r\nViewing comes highly recommended by the sole agent and by appointment only Contact Martin Finn Auctioneers Claremorris on 094 9362216\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD \r\n\r\nEircode F12W6X9"
